SUMMARY:THIS SUNDAY October 18 | Empire Strikes Brass – Benefit Concert for Homeward Bound WNC
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, October 18 | Doors: 4:00 pm | Show: 5:15 pm | Outdoor Stage | From $27.15 Event Details and Tickets \nDress up for a Homecoming Dance!  Silent auctions\, dance competitions\, and Empire Strikes Brass!  All proceeds to benefit Homeward Bound WNC \n\nAre you ready for homecoming?\n\n\nKids 12 and under attend free\, so bring the whole family and celebrate at our Homecoming Benefit Concert!\n\n\nDance to the funkalicious sounds of Empire Strikes Brass\, cheer on the kids in our junior dance competition\, browse our silent auction\, and cast your vote for Homecoming royalty – with Junior and Adult King & Queen titles up for grabs. Come dressed to impress\, show off your moves\, and relive the magic of Homecoming.\n\n\n\n\n\nEmpire Strikes Brass is a dynamic BrassFunkRock band hailing from Asheville\, North Carolina. Their music resonates with a powerful message delivered through a captivating and larger-than-life sound. Fueled by a thumping rhythm section that sets the groove\, the band’s rich horn arrangements add an extra layer of depth to both their original compositions and compelling covers\, showcasing the evolution of ESB. \nFormed in 2012\, Empire Strikes Brass began as a group of friends inspired by New Orleans second-line traditions and funk-driven rhythms infused with elements of rock and jam. Over time\, they have grown into a collective known for tight arrangements\, bold musical choices\, and a sound that seamlessly blends diverse influences while staying true to their roots. \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom with live music several days a week\, plus our outdoor music venue in the summer and fall months with live music frequently on WNC’s premier outdoor music venue\, the Pisgah Brewing Outdoor Stage. Be sure to come thirsty and ready rock! Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-sunday-october-18-empire-strikes-brass-benefit-concert-for-homeward-bound-wnc-2-2/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-31-155319-e1788206038664.png
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain 2948 US-70 Black Mountain NC 28711;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2948 US-70:geo:-82.3568213,35.6068069
END:VEVENT
