SUMMARY:TONIGHT | The Infamous Stringdusters w/sg Broken Compass Bluegrass
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 17 | Doors: 6 pm | Show: 7:30 pm | From $36.30 Event Details and Tickets\n\ncelebrate 20 years since their inception\, the ground-breaking\, Grammy Award-winning ensemble The Infamous Stringdusters—whose tone and swagger meld acoustic majesty with the energy of a full-blown rock show—mark this milestone with the release of 20/20.\nTwenty brand new songs\, born from endless miles in pursuit of a dream. Formed in Nashville in the early 2000s while performing as side-men with stalwarts of the bluegrass community\, the band members soaked up every influence like musical sponges. Their friendships\, paired with a shared drive to create their own music and master their own destiny\, inevitably led to the birth of The Infamous Stringdusters.\nAlongside Chris Pandolfi (banjo)\, Travis Book (double bass)\, Jeremy Garrett (fiddle)\, Andy Hall (dobro)\, and Andy Falco (guitar)\, the group continues to fearlessly blur the boundaries between bluegrass\, Americana\, country\, and indie-folk.\n\nAt its core\, 20/20 represents a defining chapter for the Stringdusters\, who embody sonic exploration and boundless curiosity while holding fast to musical tradition—whether under the bright stage lights or deep within the studio. \n\n\n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom with live music several days a week\, plus our outdoor music venue in the summer and fall months with live music frequently on WNC’s premier outdoor music venue\, the Pisgah Brewing Outdoor Stage. Be sure to come thirsty and ready rock! Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/the-infamous-stringdusters-w-sg-broken-compass-bluegrass/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/764925217_1528479269306244_8038160837955682202_n-e1787582332501.jpg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain 2948 US-70 Black Mountain NC 28711;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2948 US-70:geo:-82.3568213,35.6068069
END:VEVENT
