SUMMARY:COMING THURSDAY OCTOBER 22nd | Larkin Poe w/sg Chuck Prophet
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, October 22 | Amphitheater Stage | 6 PM DOORS | 6:30PM SHOW | From $45.89 Event Details and Tickets \n“A Sister Act with Staying Power” – NPR \nRebecca & Megan Lovell of Larkin Poe are Grammy-winning singer/songwriter\, multi-instrumentalist sisters creating their own brand of Roots Rock ‘n’ Roll: gritty\, soulful\, and flavored by their southern heritage. Originally from Atlanta and currently living in Nashville\, they are self-producers of an electrifying\, critically acclaimed body of work and are known for constantly touring across the globe with a fiery vitality. \nSierra Nevada Brewing Co. is one of America’s premier craft breweries\, highly regarded for using only the finest quality ingredients.  Sierra Nevada has set the standard for craft brewers worldwide with innovations in the brewhouse as well as advances in sustainability. The view from our tree-lined brewery is something special no matter the season. Tour the brewhouse\, feast in the Taproom or soak in the sun on our Back Porch with a beer\, including the legendary Pale Ale and a snack. For our upcoming event line-up click here! \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-thursday-october-22nd-larkin-poe-2/2026-10-17/
LOCATION:Sierra Nevada Mills River\, 100 Sierra Nevada Way\, Mills River\, NC\, 28732
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Mills River
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-14-114634-e1786722492688.png
