SUMMARY:Appfest ft. Laron Huntley & The Gravely Brothers
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, October 17 — Southern Appalachian Highland Conservancy will join the Appfest fun. We’re grateful to Wicked Weed Brewing for their ongoing support of our conservation work!\n\nJoin us for a great afternoon of Country\, Americana and Southern Rock with Laron Huntley & the Gravely Brothers.\n\nShop local Appalachian makers with the Appalachian Makers Collective from 12–5 PM\, then stick around for live music from 2–5 PM. Bring your people\, support local artists\, discover something new\, and spend a Saturday celebrating the place we’re lucky to call home.\n  \nLaron Huntley & The Gravely Brothers\, is a multi-generational band rooted in Asheville\, NC with a sound steeped in classic country and southern rock. With deep local ties and a shared musical heritage\, this group brings the authentic spirit of the mountains to every performance. Their show promises passion\, talent\, and timeless Americana vibes from heartfelt originals to crowd-pleasing covers and jam-worthy riffs. \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/appfest-ft-laron-huntley-the-gravely-brothers/
LOCATION:Wicked Weed Brewpub
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-14-052649-e1791971773438.png
GEO:35.591694;-82.5510325
END:VEVENT
